// The tutorial: one origin, the simplest rule, no walls.
name First Ripple
rule B1/S012345678
steps 2
hint Everything here spread from one point. Walk there (click, or WASD), press Space to plant, step off the seed, then Grow. Living ground overgrows whatever stands on it.
tip The shape is symmetric. Its centre is where it began.
intro You wake on cold ground with a lantern in your hand and no memory of lighting it. Around you lies the shape of something that once spread. It had a beginning. Find it.
outro The ground remembers. Where you planted the seed, it grew back exactly as it had.
map
